r independent inspection of live source, canonical aggregate and narrow-lite evidence. Technically verified 2026-10-02; owner visual acceptance remains open. [Correction review](project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/portal-correction-2026-10-02/review.md) · [Handoff](project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/portal-correction-2026-10-02/handoff.md). Owner visual acceptance remains open. No commit, push or deployment.\n\n> **Canonical approved task queue.** Every new task has a stable `JG-###` ID and links to an accepted plan. Change a checkbox to `[x]` only after the matching verification record exists in [`project/work/evidence/`](project/work/evidence/) and the plan status is `verified`.\n\nStart every task by reading [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md), [`project/README.md`](project/README.md), and the linked plan. The registry at [`project/work/INDEX.md`](project/work/INDEX.md) is the complete map of task state, dependencies, plans, and evidence.\n\n## Active\n\n- [ ] **JG-035 — Opening \"Drafting Table\" + Tolerance Stations: oversized drawing-sheet intro and real-GD&T CH.01 callouts** · [facts locked](project/work/inbox/JG-035-tolerance-stations-facts.md)\n  - Two coupled tracks from the 2026-09-24/25 owner direction. **Track A (intro):** replace the fit-to-screen sheet with an oversized (~3–4× viewport) drawing in the owner's cream-vellum/navy-ink reference style — line-weight hierarchy (heavy outline / medium edges / thin dimension + dashed hidden), 45° section hatching, 2:1 magnified detail circles generated from the GLB, reference-style title block; scroll camera opens tight on a detail/title-block corner, pans the sheet, settles square-on to the side elevation, then the JGun lifts out with ink→metal crossfade and a pull-back reveal of the whole sheet. **Track B (CH.01 callouts):** replace the decorative hotspots/leaders (which \"point at areas that don't mean anything\") with 5–6 tolerance stations whose facts are LOCKED in the fact sheet (S1