{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"Spec executed. All changes are in place, verified by direct reads, and the report packet is written.\n\n**Owned diff** (all unstaged; concurrent staged work untouched):\n\n- [App.tsx](C:/Users/Markimus/.buzz/REPOS/jgun-portfolio/src/App.tsx) — `canvasActive = tier !== 'poster' && !reducedMotion` (removed `motionActive`); ScrollRig, IntroTitles, ToleranceStations, TechnicalHUD, and BootSequence all follow `canvasActive`; the `rl300` study gate now requires `!reducedMotion` so reduced motion can't bypass zero-CAD via the query string; `StaticPoster` receives `reason={reducedMotion ? 'reduced-motion' : 'poster-tier'}`.\n- [StaticPoster.tsx](C:/Users/Markimus/.buzz/REPOS/jgun-portfolio/src/components/StaticPoster.tsx) — optional `reason` prop selects a truthful mode line: reduced motion reads \"REDUCED MOTION PREFERRED; ANIMATED 3D DISABLED\" instead of claiming hardware failure; default is a neutral \"STATIC RENDER MODE\".\n- [qualityStore.ts](C:/Users/Markimus/.buzz/REPOS/jgun-portfolio/src/state/qualityStore.ts) — documentation only: reduced motion gates the canvas without stepping tiers; the ladder and tier adaptation are unchanged.\n\n**Why fresh reduced-motion startup can't import/mount SceneCanvas or request CAD:** `qualityStore` evaluates the media query at module load, so App's first render computes `canvasActive === false`. `SceneCanvas` is `React.lazy` inside that branch, and lazy chunks fetch only when rendered, so the canvas chunk never imports. Every CAD URL (`Default.glb`, `msp-enclosure.glb`, `m249-transformed.glb`, `knurling-tool.glb`, `manufacturing-core-*.glb`, `rl300-lite.glb`) resolves inside those chunks. Chapters, StationNav, and RingInspection stay mounted; RingInspection's existing `staticMode` routes to `enterInspection(…, static)` → status `ready` with no runtime, and the shaft study renders real `/inspection/shaft/*.webp` rasters.\n\n**Limitations reported:** drei's `useGLTF` module cache retains parsed GLBs after a mid-session toggle (no `useGLTF.clear()` exists — memory kept, no re-download), `window.__threeCamera/__threeRenderer` probes go stale after unmount, and when reduced motion coincides with poster tier the mode line names only the preference. Two stale comments in files I don't own (StationNav, BootSequence) are flagged in the report with proposed wording, not edited.\n\nReport: [reduced-motion-posters-glm-report.md](C:/Users/Markimus/.buzz/REPOS/jgun-portfolio/project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/manufacturing-implementation-2026-10-05/reduced-motion-posters-glm-report.md) (299 words). Per spec I ran no tests/build/browser commands, and staged/committed/pushed nothing — acceptance is pending your independent full tests, build, and production lifecycle/static/opening regression."}}
